step Driver elects to re-enter the level => level and RBC data become invalid
sub Sub-step1
efs: DMI.MasterDMI().In_ErtmsEtcsLevelEntryRequest.ProvideDriverResponse()
expect efs: DMI.MasterDMI().In_ErtmsEtcsLevel.InputInformation.RequestStatus == RequestEnum.Request @ deadline=1
expect efs: EURORADIO.RBCConnection.Contact.LastKnownRBC.DataState == DataStateEnum.Invalid
expect efs: Kernel.Level.DataState == DataStateEnum.Invalid @ deadline=1
expect efs: DMI.MasterDMI().In_ErtmsEtcsLevelEntryRequest.InputInformation.RequestStatus == RequestEnum.Disabled @ deadline=1
step Driver enters the level data
sub Sub-step1
efs: 
expect efs: DMI.MasterDMI().In_ErtmsEtcsLevel.InputInformation.RequestStatus == RequestEnum.Disabled
expect efs: Kernel.Level.DataState == DataStateEnum.Valid
expect efs: Kernel.Level.Value.Value == LevelEnum.L1 @ deadline=1
